|{{va|Baby Axolotl Fan}}
|[[File:Baby Axolotl Fan.png|width=131x131]]
|A dark skinned character with blue eyes wearing a onesie themed around the ocean. Their head, upper shoulders and chest area having the leucistic, gold, cyan, and blue [[axolotl]] variants. Their boots and gloves colored as leather being underwater. Along the pants is kelp streaking towards the chest. 
|Simplified versions both of the Baby Axolotl Top and Hat, made to fit the limitations of [[Skin|skins]]. 
|-
|{{va|Baby Bee Fan}}
|[[File:Baby Bee Fan.png|width=131x131]]
|A tan skinned character wearing a bee themed outfit with the chest area having a honeycomb pattern. Their head and upper shoulders wearing an adult and baby [[bee]] inspired clothing with honey dripping across the arms.  
|Simplified versions both of the Baby Bee Top and Hat, made to fit the limitations of [[Skin|skins]]. Removing the bee hood reveals the character has no eyes.
|}

